<p>I've actually already thought about the themes of each of the copies and what they could represent.</p>
<ul>
<li>The Doctor represents missed lesson opportunities and not paying as much attention as he could.</li>
<li>The military officer represents the man's attitude and also serves as the main driving force that he isn't good enough.</li>
<li>The business man represents missed opportunities in his life and tells him ways he could have been better.</li>
<li>The final man will just sit and look at the SCP for a while, shake his head, then disappear. He represents the idea that people have just lost hope for him.</li>
</ul>
<p>I'll need to think a little more about how I want to do the suicide attempt, I want an outcome that doesn't just simply solve all his problems, but is still a little hopeful for the future.</p>

